# <type>(<scope>): <imperative summary, ≤72 chars, no period>
#
# Types:   feat | fix | docs | test | refactor | chore
# Scopes:  cli | balance | weather | config | storage | report | action | deps
#
# Body (optional): what & why, not how. One or two sentences.
# Footer: BREAKING CHANGE: ... / closes #123
#
# Versioning: feat → minor bump, fix → patch, BREAKING CHANGE → minor (pre-1.0).
# See COMMITS.md for the full convention.
